- Use styled-components for component-scoped CSS with JavaScript template literals.
- Implement proper theming with ThemeProvider for consistent design systems.
- Use props-based styling for dynamic and conditional component appearances.
- Create reusable styled components with proper composition and inheritance.
- Implement responsive design with theme breakpoints and media query helpers.
- Use styled-components' CSS helper for complex styles and animations.
- Apply proper naming conventions for styled components and theme variables.
- Optimize performance with styled-components' shouldForwardProp for prop filtering.
- Use styled-components' attrs helper for setting default props and attributes.
- Implement proper TypeScript integration with styled-components for type safety.

